cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit or its results, please cite the master's thesis it is part of (preferred citation below)."
title: "5LTEP-L3: 5L-TEP Layer 3 Anomaly Detection Toolkit"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of Layer 3 (Anomaly Detection) of the Five-Layer
  Trust Engineering Pyramid (5L-TEP, SOFTENG 2026) for open government data: an
  ensemble of statistical and learned detectors with a Page-Hinkley drift test,
  a local LLM-as-a-Judge (Ollama) that classifies each anomaly, and a
  human-in-the-loop review through GitHub Issues. Declarative profiles adapt it
  to other CKAN portals, datasets and data cuts. Part of the master's thesis
  cited below.
type: software
